# The Expert two-stream route of the Way Home in co-op (designer DB3; P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S; recorded from
# closed-loop duo macros, build/db3/bot_ending_coop.gd). P1 opens the spots of the path - the inset tile, the road's
# two hidden spots (columns 33-34) and the bush - and P2 trails him; at the barred
# village gate P1 stands under the end of the lookout gallery and P2 Shoulder-Hops off his head onto it - onto the
# latch plate: the gate rises for good - takes Cave Painting 29 by the watch hut and drops back to the road while P1
# walks through the gate; P1 clubs the barrels and the pot of the village and both reach the exit totem
# (the team exit). Club only, no S; nobody stands 243 ticks without input.
# Re-recorded in wf11 (levels; build/levels/bot_ending_coop.gd, DB3's bot with two more stops): the road's two
# hidden spots moved to columns 33-34 at G70 (they lay under the tablet) and the old keys walked past them.
